		<h1>About</h1>
		<p>Mike Daly is a creative director, media artist and filmmaker working with Australia's leading arts & culture organisations. His work includes immersive digital installations, interactive data visualisations, narrative-driven web experiences, light installations, media scenography and traditional films.</p>
        <p>He has worked extensively with major cultural institutions including the Sydney Opera House, Sydney Dance Company, Sydney Theatre Company, Sydney Chamber Opera, Ballet de Lorraine, ACMI, Museums Victoria, Powerhouse Museum, State Library of NSW and State Library Victoria.</p>
        <p>Mike’s work has been highly awarded, winning gold at Cannes Lions, D&AD, Ciclope, the Webby Awards, the Good Design Awards and more. His projects have been selected for Prix Ars Electronica, Cannes Film Festival, SXSW and other esteemed international creative festivals.</p>
